[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9360.55, "timestamp": "02:36:00", "text": "我们可以做一个。哦。哦，等等。我有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9363.349, "timestamp": "02:36:03", "text": "外汇，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9365.67, "timestamp": "02:36:05", "text": "兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9368.15, "timestamp": "02:36:08", "text": "没关系。她现在就在办公室里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9371.349, "timestamp": "02:36:11", "text": "是的。是的。凯蒂的合约到期"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9374.63, "timestamp": "02:36:14", "text": "四个 3 小时。凯西在哪儿？理发师"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9377.429, "timestamp": "02:36:17", "text": "店铺。糟糕，这可真棘手。呃，过来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9380.15, "timestamp": "02:36:20", "text": "莫拉，跟我来。莫拉，莫拉。是的，莫拉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9381.15, "timestamp": "02:36:21", "text": "哦，跟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9386.469, "timestamp": "02:36:26", "text": "我。呃，什么？好了，警察到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9387.99, "timestamp": "02:36:27", "text": "正在观看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9388.83, "timestamp": "02:36:28", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9391.99, "timestamp": "02:36:31", "text": "所以，我打算分散警察的注意力。你做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9394.63, "timestamp": "02:36:34", "text": "不过，该如何处理“凯西在哪儿？”这个问题呢？在哪里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9396.63, "timestamp": "02:36:36", "text": "你是？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9401.63, "timestamp": "02:36:41", "text": "我在这里。在你身后。好的。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9405.75, "timestamp": "02:36:45", "text": "凯西就在这儿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9413.91, "timestamp": "02:36:53", "text": "转移。转移。好的。逃跑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9415.429, "timestamp": "02:36:55", "text": "逃跑。逃跑。逃跑。哦。哦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9417.63, "timestamp": "02:36:57", "text": "等待。好的。如果他们"}]